**Key idea:** Bundle settings into a **hierarchy of configuration objects** (`env_cfg` holding one `agent_cfg` per agent), build and randomize them **once in the test**, push the top object down with a **single `uvm_config_db::set`**, and let each level hand the sub-object to its children. That gives one lookup per level instead of hundreds of scattered `set`/`get` calls on individual fields.

