  TEST -->|set env cfg| ENV["uvm_env: get env_cfg"]
  ENV -->|set agt0 cfg| A0["agent 0: get agent_cfg"]
  ENV -->|set agt1 cfg| A1["agent 1: get agent_cfg"]
  ENV -->|handle| SCB["scoreboard"]
  A0 --> D0["driver and monitor read cfg.vif"]
```

